    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Fixing Buggy Code\r\n\r\n1. Test the bug. Run the app, click **Filter: Nut-Free**, then **Reset Data**. The nut items are gone and the filter permanently overwrote the global list.\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Rewrite `filterNutFree()` to build and return a new list instead of changing bakedGoods, then pass that returned list to `renderMenu()` in the button's listener.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
